{
  "name": "27 · Expense Categoriser (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 27 · Expense Categoriser\nSnap a bill or receipt and send it to your Telegram bot or business WhatsApp → AI reads vendor, amount, GST and picks a category → new row in your **Expenses** sheet → you get a ✅ reply. Unclear photos are marked CHECK.\n\n**Setup (15 min)**\n1. Telegram nodes: add a **Telegram API** credential (bot token from @BotFather) and replace YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID. (no chat ID needed here: it replies to the sender).\n2. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup).\n3. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Expenses**: Added, Date, Vendor, Amount, GST, Category, Mode, Confidence, Status, Sent by, Note.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini). (the model must support images; Claude does).\n\nUse only one of the two triggers if you like: just delete the other one.",
        "height": 679,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "bdfc4c86-926b-4f39-a71e-addf0c8f8701",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {
          "download": true
        }
      },
      "id": "c3766908-34f9-4e5b-a117-71d33136a30d",
      "name": "Receipt on Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ]
      },
      "id": "d6373edb-de26-480d-b0ad-f3a79b189f18",
      "name": "Receipt on WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return { json: { channel: 'telegram', chat: $json.message?.chat?.id, from: $json.message?.from?.first_name || '', note: $json.message?.caption || '' }, binary: $input.item.binary };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "fd7cb1b4-7260-434b-8161-6c8954fc01c7",
      "name": "Tag: Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "media",
        "operation": "mediaUrlGet",
        "mediaGetId": "={{ $json.messages[0].image?.id || $json.messages[0].document?.id }}"
      },
      "id": "a97d02e6-1175-42e5-b2b2-478486ff07f0",
      "name": "Get photo URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "whatsAppApi",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "075c25a6-587a-4416-a592-efb733290c9d",
      "name": "Download photo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const t = $('Receipt on WhatsApp').item.json;\nreturn { json: { channel: 'whatsapp', chat: t.messages?.[0]?.from, from: t.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '', note: t.messages?.[0]?.image?.caption || '' }, binary: $input.item.binary };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "2d506b1f-aa92-4940-9d37-8f6d936a9b47",
      "name": "Tag: WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=This photo is a bill or receipt for a business expense. The sender's note: \"{{ $json.note }}\".\nRead it and return: vendor, date (yyyy-mm-dd, null if not printed), amount (final total paid, number), gst (number, 0 if none), category (one of: Rent, Salary, Stock purchase, Raw material, Electricity, Internet/Phone, Fuel/Travel, Food/Tea, Repairs, Marketing, Bank charges, Other), payment_mode (cash / UPI / card / bank / unknown), confidence 0-1. Never guess numbers that are not readable: use null and low confidence.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "type": "HumanMessagePromptTemplate",
              "messageType": "imageBinary",
              "binaryImageDataKey": "data"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "5140efc3-13fd-4268-b42d-fa96a13c801d",
      "name": "AI reads receipt",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "fecd3ef3-2177-4971-a40b-486c2d3cb4d8",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        900,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"vendor\": \"Sri Balaji Electricals\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-27\",\n  \"amount\": 2360,\n  \"gst\": 360,\n  \"category\": \"Repairs\",\n  \"payment_mode\": \"UPI\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.92\n}"
      },
      "id": "1b319b5c-a7e8-4d0c-98a9-4047e6ee2ab3",
      "name": "JSON shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const pick = n => { try { return $(n).item.json; } catch (e) { return null; } };\nconst src = pick('Tag: Telegram') || pick('Tag: WhatsApp') || {};\nconst o = $json.output;\nreturn { json: { Added: $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd HH:mm'), Date: o.date || $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd'),\n  Vendor: o.vendor, Amount: o.amount, GST: o.gst, Category: o.category, Mode: o.payment_mode, Confidence: o.confidence,\n  Status: o.confidence < 0.7 || o.amount == null ? 'CHECK' : 'OK', 'Sent by': src.from, Note: src.note, channel: src.channel, chat: src.chat } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "a0e56043-bf4e-48de-b788-39256931ed65",
      "name": "Expense row",
